  "details": "Many people are creating their own playable layers from scratch assuming that the default controllers will still exist, for example they override gestures playable layer and get confused why they no longer have default hand emotes.\nI think it might be more straightforward to create a copy of the example playable layer and default it to set in the slot as soon as the override button is hit for that playable layer. That way people then \"see\" the default playable layer and can easily add to it.",
